This test produce a short trajectory for solvated FKB12 with ligand using
the OpenMP executable (8 threads)

The input file is md.in
the starting conf of the FKBP12-ligand is the file in start.pdb 
potential parameters are in the directory ../ff/

To run this test  just do form this directory 

../../src/GNU-FFTW-OMP/orac < md.in > test1.md.out

The test should produce the follwoing files
test1.md.out    -> general gromacs/like (md.log) output
test1.G0.tt     -> time record of the energies for energy conservation check
test1.md_1.pdb  -> trajetoru file 
test1.com.dat   -> logand-protein com-com distance file  

reference output are in the files
md.out    
G0.tt     
md_1.pdb  
com.dat    

More info (potential, type of simulation, Ewald etc) in the md.in input files  
 
CPU/elapsed timing for the various tasks are at the bottom of md.out 
